## Notice on derived material

This license covers the original code and prose in this repo. It does not
cover two kinds of material this repo derives from other sources.

The first kind is example data. `before-after-samples.md` and
`experiment-results.md` hold samples and results built on the method shown
in the video and source repo named in the README. Credit for that method
goes to its author.

The second kind is `ste-recurring-errors.md`. It restates a 39-item error
list from ASD-STE100 Issue 9 as structured data, for use by the linter and
skill in this repo.

ASD-STE100 is a registered EU trademark (No. 017966390) of AeroSpace and
Defence Industries Association of Europe (ASD). This repo does not own, and
does not claim to own, the standard itself. The full standard is free to
read at https://asd-ste100.org.
